Apache License 2.0 above.

`pnpm models:provision` downloads them from Hugging Face, from the model
repository LiquidAI/LFM3-Omni-2B-ONNX at the pinned revision
7d6bd3fd59a0622e5ce7fefc141145a8bba1435a:

  https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM3-Omni-2B-ONNX

The Hugging Face model card of that repository (read on 2026-10-30) declares
